Main Resources
===============================================

Site
  A place on the network where applications are running
  One per Namespace

Link
  A channel for communication between two Sites

Listener
  Binds a local connection endpoint (host + port) to 
  Connectors in remote sites. This is what exposes a
  Service to the network.

Connector
  Binds a local workload to Listeners in remote sites. 
  This is what consumes a remote Service.



Site Linking Resources
===============================================

AccessGrant
  Permission to create links to the local site. 
  It issues short-lived tokens that remote sites can redeem.

AccessToken
  A short-lived credential generated from an AccessGrant. 
  A remote site uses it to create a Link.

RouterAccess
  How the Skupper router is exposed externally for incoming links.







